1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:01,992
Iklan belajar dari klik.

2
00:00:01,992 --> 00:00:04,180
Padahal yang kamu butuh: pembeli.

3
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:10,697
Buka Pengaturan Konversi,
pilih tipe kampanye.

4
00:00:11,800 --> 00:00:14,649
Setiap status lead punya event
iklannya sendiri.

5
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:19,219
Saat chat masuk, lead
tercatat di Konektor.

6
00:00:22,600 --> 00:00:26,507
Begitu deal, ubah statusnya jadi
closing dan isi nilainya.

7
00:00:29,400 --> 00:00:32,019
Konektor langsung kirim Purchase ke Meta.

8
00:00:32,019 --> 00:00:32,594
Diterima!

9
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:38,779
Iklan kamu belajar dari pembeli
asli, bukan cuma klik.

10
00:00:42,600 --> 00:00:44,003
Mau tanpa klik manual?

11
00:00:44,003 --> 00:00:47,448
Status bisa berubah otomatis
lewat Aturan Otomatisasi.

12
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:52,108
Panduannya, di konektor.id.
